  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>e</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
